	{
		"path": "/root/Codex/@HBoxContainer@292/@ScrollContainer@480/@VBoxContainer@481/@Label@495",
		"rect": "[P: (374.0, 544.0), S: (888.0, 483.0)]",
		"text": "Q Venomous Pressure Points　cd10s\n    The Divine Physician turns medicine against his foes, sealing pressure points along a line for 40 damage and a heavy slow.\n    Piercing damage 40/56/72\n\nW Life-Saving Shallow Grave　cd14s\n    Use life-restoring arts to shield nearby allies for 0 damage and cleanse crowd-control effects and debuffs. Even the dying may be saved.\n    Cleanse (remove ally debuffs)\n\nE Shadow Wave　cd8s\n    The Divine Physician sends a wave bouncing between friend and foe. Each imperial troop struck takes 40 damage, while each ally touched restores the same amount of HP.\n    6 bounces · Enemy damage 40/56/72 / Ally healing 40/56/72\n\nR Weave　cd40s\n    An Daoquan weaves medicinal poison across a wide battlefield area, continually reducing enemy armor.\n    Damage 10/14/18  Armor −3"
	},
	{
		"path": "/root/Codex/@HBoxContainer@292/@ScrollContainer@480/@VBoxContainer@481/@HBoxContainer@496/@Label@497",
